{"header":{"OB_REQUEST_ID":"26c61d13-b40d-4e3a-a680-82bfb5ccfeac","result.val":0,"http.code":200,"result.text":"OK"},"data":{"message":{"id":686081,"messageId":686081,"newsId":638695,"title":"Equinor ASA: Share buy-back - fourth tranche for 2026","body":"Please see below information about transactions made under the fourth tranche of\nthe 2026 share buy-back programme for Equinor ASA (OSE:EQNR, NYSE:EQNR,\nCEUX:EQNRO, TQEX:EQNRO).\n\nDate on which the buy-back tranche was announced: 28 October 2026.\n\nThe duration of the buy-back tranche: 29 October 2026 to no later than 1\nFebruary 2027.\n\nFurther information on the tranche can be found in the stock market announcement\non its commencement dated 28 October 2026, available here:\nhttps://newsweb.oslobors.no/message/684948\n\nFrom 2 November to 6 November 2026, Equinor ASA has purchased a total of\n709,000 own shares at an average price of NOK 412.6135 per share.\n\nOverview of transactions:\n\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|Date              |Trading     |              |       Daily|                  |\n|                  |venue       |    Aggregated|    weighted|                  |\n|                  |            |  daily volume|     average|       Total daily|\n|                  |            |    (number of| share price| transaction value|\n|                  |            |       shares)|       (NOK)|             (NOK)|\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |            |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|2 November        |OSE         |       136,000|    432.9401|     58,879,853.60|\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |CEUX        |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |TQEX        |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |            |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|3 November        |OSE         |       138,000|    423.4547|     58,436,748.60|\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |CEUX        |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |TQEX        |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |            |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|4 November        |OSE         |       141,000|    413.6650|     58,326,765.00|\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |CEUX        |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |TQEX        |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |            |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|5 November        |OSE         |       145,000|    400.8870|     58,128,615.00|\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |CEUX        |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |TQEX        |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |            |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|6 November        |OSE         |       149,000|    394.4364|     58,771,023.60|\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |CEUX        |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |TQEX        |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |            |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|Total for the     |OSE         |              |            |                  |\n|period            |            |       709,000|    412.6135|    292,543,005.80|\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |CEUX        |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |TQEX        |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |            |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|Previously        |OSE         |       265,300|    441.0372|    117,007,167.13|\n|disclosed buy-    +------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|backs under the   |CEUX        |              |            |                  |\n|tranche           +------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |TQEX        |              |            |                  |\n|                  +------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |Total       |       265,300|    441.0372|    117,007,167.13|\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |            |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|Total buy-backs   |OSE         |       974,300|    420.3533|    409,550,172.93|\n|under the tranche +------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|(accumulated)     |CEUX        |              |            |                  |\n|                  +------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |TQEX        |              |            |                  |\n|                  +------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |Total       |       974,300|    420.3533|    409,550,172.93|\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n\n\nFollowing completion of the above transactions, Equinor ASA owns a total of\n24,570,117 own shares, corresponding to 1.03% of Equinor ASA's share capital,\nincluding shares under Equinor's share savings programme (excluding shares under\nEquinor's share savings programme, Equinor owns a total of 13,265,882 own\nshares, corresponding to 0.55% of the share capital).\n\nThis is information that Equinor ASA is obliged to make public pursuant to the\nEU Market Abuse Regulation and that is subject to the disclosure requirements\npursuant to Section 5-12 of the Norwegian Securities Trading Act.\n\nAppendix: An overview of all transactions made under the buy-back tranche that\nhave been carried out during the above-mentioned time period is attached to this\nreport and available at http://www.newsweb.no.\n\nContact details:\n\nInvestor relations\nBård Glad Pedersen, senior vice president Investor Relations,\n+47 918 01 791\n\nMedia\nSissel Rinde, vice president Media Relations,\n+47 412 60 584\n","category":[{"id":1007,"category_no":"UTSTEDERS MELDEPLIKT VED HANDEL I EGNE AKSJER","category_en":"ACQUISITION OR DISPOSAL OF AN ISSUER'S OWN SHARES"}],"markets":["XOSL"],"issuerId":1309,"correctionForMessageId":0,"correctedByMessageId":0,"issuerSign":"EQNR","issuerName":"Equinor ASA","instrId":0,"instrumentName":"","instrumentFullName":"","publishedTime":"2026-11-10T07:00:09.822Z","test":false,"numbAttachments":1,"attachments":[{"id":336154,"name":"Detailed overview of transactions.pdf"}],"clientAnnouncementId":"e89725ff-396c-46f5-b8c6-734fa821862d","infoRequired":1,"oamMandatory":1}}}